  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      178.05,
      204.17,
      385.65,
      229.31
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE PHARMACEUTICAL SOCIETY OFSRI LANKA",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      245.57,
      401.91,
      339.71
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS a Society called and known as the\u201cPharmaceutical Society of Sri Lanka\u201d has been establishedin Sri Lanka for the common progress of involving inPharmacology and all its branches and for the purpose ofeffectually carrying out and transacting all objects andmatters connected with the Society according to the rulesagreed by its members:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      355.97,
      401.91,
      422.51
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the said Society has heretofore successfullycarried out and transacted the several objects and matters forwhich it was established and has applied to be incorporatedand it will be for the public advantage to grant theapplication:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      438.77,
      401.89,
      463.91
    ],
    "text": "BE it therefore enacted by Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      480.17,
      401.91,
      505.31
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Pharmaceutical Societyof Sri Lanka (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2015.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      521.57,
      401.89,
      670.91
    ],
    "text": "2.From and after the date at commencement of this Actsuch and so many persons as now are members of thePharmaceutical Society of Sri Lanka (hereinafter referred toas \u201cSociety\u201d) or shall hereafter be admitted members of theCorporation hereby constituted shall be and becomea body corporate (herein after referred to as \u201cthe Corporation\u201d)with perpetual succession under the style and the name ofthe \u201cPharmaceutical Society of Sri Lanka\u201d and by thatname may sue and be sued in all courts with full power andauthority to have and to use a common seal and to alter thesame at its pleasure.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      521.11,
      455.86,
      568.58
    ],
    "text": "Incorporationof thePharmaceuticalSociety of SriLanka.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      167.17,
      352.16,
      190.24
    ],
