      403.15,
      203.35,
      450.44,
      231.62
    ],
    "text": "Generalobjects of theCorporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      203.09,
      397.17,
      226.79
    ],
    "text": "3.The general objects for which the corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      240.05,
      397.19,
      263.63
    ],
    "text": "(a)to promote and advance the science of Pharmacyand its applications in Sri Lanka;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      276.89,
      397.18,
      337.43
    ],
    "text": "(b)to advise the Government and give council to publiccorporations, local bodies and other institutionson all matters connected with the application ofpharmacy to progress and development of theCountry;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      350.69,
      397.2,
      374.39
    ],
    "text": "(c)to promote the acquisition, dissemination andinterchange of pharmaceutical knowledge by",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      199.15,
      387.65,
      397.17,
      423.59
    ],
    "text": "(i)providing a forum for the presentation oforiginal communications and discussionsthereon;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      196.15,
      436.85,
      375.46,
      448.19
    ],
    "text": "(ii)establishing and maintaining libraries;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      193.15,
      461.45,
      397.19,
      485.03
    ],
    "text": "(iii)publishing matters of interest to theprofessions of pharmacy; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      193.87,
      498.29,
      286.88,
      509.63
    ],
    "text": "(iv)any other means;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      522.89,
      386.64,
      534.23
    ],
    "text": "(d)to promote education in pharmacy at all levels;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      547.49,
      397.17,
      571.19
    ],
    "text": "(e)to promote, encourage and foster original researchin pharmacy;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.15,
      584.45,
      397.17,
      608.03
    ],
    "text": "(f)to assess the eligibility of candidates for admissionto the various grades of membership;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      621.29,
      397.19,
      669.59
    ],
    "text": "(g)to conduct or provide for the conduct of thequalifying examinations for all grades ofmembership of the Society and to promote, provideor approve courses of study for such examinations;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      206.85,
      167.17,
      402.89,
      190.24
