    ],
    "text": "6.(1) It shall be lawful for the Corporation from time totime at any Annual General Meeting or at a special GeneralMeeting of the Society and by the requisite majority of themembers voting, to make rules and by-laws not inconsistencewith the provisions of this Act or any other written law forthe management of the affairs of the society andaccomplishment if its objectives including all or any of thefollowing matters:\u2014",
