    ],
    "text": "7.All debts and liabilities of the Society existing onthe day immediately preceding the date of commencementof this Act, shall be paid and discharged by the Corporationand all debts due to, subscription and contributions payableto the Society shall be paid to the Corporation for the purposeof this Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
